Gate the RX1 and RX2 AXI streams to a TXDATA-triggered ADF4159 single ramp.
Expose MUXOUT, active and sticky done through PS EMIO GPIO, with software
abort and bypass lines. Register the local axis_gate IP in the ADI library.

